{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE15defaultPositionyQrAA9UnitPointVF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","title":"defaultPosition(_:)","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultPosition"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI9UnitPointV","text":"UnitPoint"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultPosition","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"position","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnitPoint","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI9UnitPointV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"position","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" that specifies where to place a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"newly opened window relative to the screen bounds."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that uses a default position for new windows."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The first time your app opens a window from a particular scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declaration, the system places the window at the center of the screen by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default. For scene types that support multiple simultaneous windows, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system offsets each additional window by a small amount to avoid"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completely obscuring existing windows."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can override the default placement of the first window by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applying a scene modifier that indicates where to place the window"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"relative to the screen bounds. For example, you can request that the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system place a new window in the bottom trailing corner of the screen:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            ContentView()","        }","        .defaultPosition(.bottomTrailing)","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The system aligns the point in the window that corresponds to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specified "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint"},{"type":"text","text":" with the point in the screen that corresponds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the same unit point."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You typically use one of the predefined unit points — like","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint\/bottomTrailing"},{"text":" in the above example — but","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"you can also use a custom unit point. For example, the following","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"modifier aligns the point that’s one quarter of the way from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leading edge of the window with the point that’s one quarter of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the way from the leading edge of the screen, while centering the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"window in the y-dimension:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["WindowGroup {","    ContentView()","}",".defaultPosition(UnitPoint(x: 0.25, y: 0.5))"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The modifier affects any scene type that creates windows in macOS,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"namely:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Window","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DocumentGroup"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Settings","type":"codeVoice"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The value that you provide acts only as an initial default. During state"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"restoration, the system restores the window to the position that it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"last occupied."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Sets a default position for a window.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/modifiedcontent\/defaultposition(_:)"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent\/defaultPosition(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent"]]},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/ModifiedContent/defaultPosition(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/ModifiedContent\/defaultPosition(_:)","title":"defaultPosition(_:)","abstract":[{"text":"Sets a default position for a window.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultPosition"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnitPoint","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI9UnitPointV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/modifiedcontent\/defaultposition(_:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/WindowGroup":{"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/windowgroup","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"WindowGroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WindowGroup","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WindowGroup","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that presents a group of identically structured windows."}]}